qGt5Xt0DZ0yFc8XE%3D","duration":43306,"title":"古董捡漏：网约车的开挂人生","video_desc":"网约车司机陈易阳意外获得鉴宝异能，踏入古玩行业。坚守道义底线，不为暴利所惑，配合警方捣毁非法鬼市、打击文物造假黑产，守护传统文化市场。他结识江晚晴，携手面对生活与事业的重重风波，对抗不法奸商。二人坚守本心，以正向的行事理念，诠释当代青年的责任担当。","series_id":"7699457416659749913","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106235803A02BD0BDDB075B908FCB\",\"rank\":\"7\",\"queue_names\":\"aigc,shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7699457416659749913\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"finish\\\":0.002472623949870467,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.309350609779358,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.9495519399642944,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.5394595265388489,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.018629536032676697,\\\"collect\\\":0.10087861120700836,\\\"like\\\":0.13028542697429657}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7699457416659749913","play_cnt":6645646,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"河南云梭映彩文化科技有限公司","sub_title":"都市·全666集","score":"8.3","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":666,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5478,\"name\":\"都市\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5478&categoryName=都市&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5503,\"name\":\"逆袭翻身\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5503&categoryName=逆袭翻身&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5694,\"name\":\"传承觉醒\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5694&categoryName=传承觉醒&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5695,\"name\":\"异能\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5695&categoryName=异能&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5750,\"name\":\"探险寻秘\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5750&categoryName=探险寻秘&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5756,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5756&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gende